sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.35) Rephora Mobile Client
        participant UI as Flutter UI
        participant AssetManager as AssetManager
        participant Prefs as SharedPreferences
        participant ImageCache as CachedNetworkImage
    end

    box rgba(90, 63, 30, 0.30) Amazon S3
        participant PublicS3 as Public assets bucket
    end

    rect rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.07)
        Note over UI,PublicS3: Manifest sync path reuses local JSON unless S3 ETag changed
        UI->>AssetManager: Sync assets manifest
        AssetManager->>Prefs: Read cached manifest JSON and ETag
        AssetManager->>PublicS3: GET assets_manifest.json with Referer and If None Match
        Note over PublicS3: Bucket policy validates the expected Referer signature

        alt Manifest unchanged
            PublicS3-->>AssetManager: Not Modified response
            AssetManager->>Prefs: Keep cached manifest JSON
        else First load or manifest changed
            PublicS3-->>AssetManager: OK response with manifest JSON and ETag
            AssetManager->>Prefs: Store manifest JSON and ETag
        end
    end

    rect rgba(224, 169, 109, 0.08)
        Note over UI,PublicS3: Avatar path downloads directly from public S3 with anti hotlinking header
        UI->>ImageCache: Render avatar URL from manifest or profile metadata
        ImageCache->>PublicS3: GET avatar image with Referer
        Note over PublicS3: Same Referer policy protects avatar reads from casual hotlinking
        PublicS3-->>ImageCache: Stream image bytes
        ImageCache-->>UI: Render cached avatar
    end

    Note over PublicS3: Private reports bucket is separate and used for presigned artifacts, not avatar delivery
